WEBVTT

00:00:29.058 --> 00:00:31.600
because I don't know
what chemicals are in it.

00:00:32.892 --> 00:00:38.284
I used to go fishing in Vancouver,
my home, with my dad,

00:00:38.308 --> 00:00:40.076
until just a few years ago,

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:42.517
we found the fish full of cancers.

00:00:43.767 --> 00:00:47.900
SCS: A generation ago,
I was that 12-year-old child.

00:00:47.949 --> 00:00:50.743
In 1992, I had five minutes

00:00:50.767 --> 00:00:55.076
to speak to the UN's Earth Summit
in Rio de Janeiro.

00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:58.118
My friends and I had started
an environmental club,

00:00:58.142 --> 00:01:02.243
and we'd traveled
to this huge international meeting